Package: mechGEA
Title: Mechanist Bayesian Genotype-Environment Association Analyses with Likelihoods
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("William", "Hemstrom", email = "hemstrow@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nikunj", "Goel", email = "nikunj410@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "ctb")),
    person("Prashant", "Ghimire", email = "pghimir1@kent.edu", role = c("aut", "ctb")),
    person("Erica", "Robertson", role = c("aut", "ctb")))
Description: A user-friendly interface for conducting Bayesian 
    Genotype-Environment Association (GEA) tests with genotype-likelihood or 
    pool-seq data, based on Goel et al. (2026)'s approaches incorporating
    migration rate estimation in spatially structured populations.
